  "id": "https://samsm.ch/portfolio-i/",
  "type": "Article",
  "name": "Portfolio I",
  "summary": "\u003cp\u003eThis series of photographs represents approximately a years worth of work,\nstarting in \u003ctime\u003eApril 2016\u003c/time\u003e when I got my Hasselblad. I chose to start\nthen not because I feel that the change of camera increased the quality of\nimages that I was producing but rather I wanted to keep the format consistent\nthroughout. Also it was about a year after I started shooting film, and when I\nstarted pursuing photography as a hobby.\u003c/p\u003e",
  "content": "\u003cp\u003eThis series of photographs represents approximately a years worth of work,\nstarting in \u003ctime\u003eApril 2016\u003c/time\u003e when I got my Hasselblad. I chose to start\nthen not because I feel that the change of camera increased the quality of\nimages that I was producing but rather I wanted to keep the format consistent\nthroughout. Also it was about a year after I started shooting film, and when I\nstarted pursuing photography as a hobby.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/2508/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/2508/2508.avif\"\n         title=\"Under the Bridge\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a graffitied brick wall with two tall openings and a lamp post to the right\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"2508\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eUnder the Bridge\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/3207/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/3207/3207.avif\"\n         title=\"Ruined House\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of some low ruined dry stone walls that once formed a house, with a dead tree to the left and a clear sky above\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"3207\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eRuined House\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/3308/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/3308/3308.avif\"\n         title=\"Llyn Cau\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of rocks in a lake with the far side of the lake barely visible due to low cloud\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"3308\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eLlyn Cau\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/3409/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/3409/3409.avif\"\n         title=\"Mauerpark Karaoke\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a crowd sat on a slope watching a performer in the foreground\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"999\"\n\t\t id=\"3409\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eMauerpark Karaoke\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/3606/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/3606/3606.avif\"\n         title=\"Wetzsteinhorn\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a vast forested valley with the mountain at the top of the frame being above the tree line, and the corner of a dam peeking out at the top of the valley\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"3606\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eWetzsteinhorn\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/3612/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/3612/3612.avif\"\n         title=\"Matterhorn\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of the Matterhorn on the lower left of the frame with a partly cloudy sky above\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"3612\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eMatterhorn\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/3902/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/3902/3902.avif\"\n         title=\"Rocks\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of some large boulders with bits of small plants peeking out between\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"3902\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eRocks\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/4012/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/4012/4012.avif\"\n         title=\"Wye\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a dead tree in from of a leafless forest, and next to a dark but somewhat reflective river which takes up the lower third of the frame\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"4012\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eWye\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/4405/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/4405/4405.avif\"\n         title=\"Fire Exit\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of 3 fire exits on a building with light coloured tiles on the lower half shown and darker tiles on the upper half, and a security camera to the upper left.\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"4405\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eFire Exit\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/4408/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/4408/4408.avif\"\n         title=\"Bickenhill Plantation\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a thick forest with a white birch tree in the centre\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"4408\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eBickenhill Plantation\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/4503/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/4503/4503.avif\"\n         title=\"Nyhavn\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking down at the bow of a wooden boat covered in various items including a large dog sat on a cushion\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"4503\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eNyhavn\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/4609/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/4609/4609.avif\"\n         title=\"Tarn Hows Road\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a country road weaving through a moor with a few trees on either side and some larger hills in the background\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"4609\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eTarn Hows Road\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBetween taking these photos at least a year and a half ago, compiling this\nseries 6 months ago and now, my opinion of these images doesn\u0026rsquo;t seem to have\nchanged too much. I think I can put this down to the memories I have attached to\nthese photos and the fact that I didn\u0026rsquo;t take a whole lot else that was any good.\u003c/p\u003e",
  "url": "https://samsm.ch/portfolio-i/",
  "published": "2018-11-09T00:00:00Z",
